🧂 Mentioned Items (Get your gear):

Skim Milk Powder: Zero Fat Milk Power, Non Fat Mik Powder, Skim Milk Powder
Invert Sugars: Corn Syrup (dark or light), honey, maple syrup, glucose, invert sugar, golden syrup
Thermometers:  Any laser thermometer, sugar thermometer, candy thermometer
Dextrose / Corn Sugar: Can be called brewers sugar, dextrose, corn sugar, beer sugar
Digital Scales (standard + microgram): Any digital scales for large weighing, these for stabilizers: http://tiny.cc/5a1h001
Guar Gum Stabilizer: Guar gum is great, Xanthan gum is an alternative but not as good. 

